    "text": "Let the position vectors of the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mi>C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math> Let the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">{</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8712;</mo><mi>&#8477;</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">:</mo></math> the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mi>C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> are coplanar<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>}</mo><mo>.</mo></math> The&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">(</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
