  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">)</mo></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>D</mi></math>&nbsp;are coplanar.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>[</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Expand the determinant along the first row.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>On solving the above equation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>We have two values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8712;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></munder><mo>(</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>41</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8712;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></munder><mo>(</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>41</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
